{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫集團再度揚威亞洲，奪得「2026亞洲影藝創意大獎」（中國香港地區）（Asian Academy Creative Awards 2026– National Winners (Hong Kong SAR)）13項殊榮，涵蓋劇集、綜藝節目、新聞及資訊內容節目等，所有獎項亦已自動入圍角逐亞洲地區冠軍大獎。無綫集團合共贏得中國香港地區13項獎項殊榮，成績斐然。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yA4SthKOKG1790909613.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dcPg1zYJgW1790909625.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">一眾節目當中，由製作組與企業傳訊部品牌傳播科攜手合作，破天荒將AI元素融入歷史節目、讓觀眾可沉浸式體驗歷史重要時刻的《走過歷史大地》，共獲得三個獎項，分別是「最佳資訊娛樂節目」、「最佳電視或長片視覺特效」，以及黃翠如憑節目獲得「最佳娛樂節目主持」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20265WFcXuSI0L1790909642.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"007.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263Vnm1z6LPX1790909660.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"007.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">至於同樣獲獎的，還有《正義女神》、《飛常日誌II》及AI微動畫短劇《社畜求生101》。《社畜求生101》包攬了「最佳喜劇」及「最佳短片節目」；《飛常日誌II》奪「最佳品牌節目」及「最佳主題曲/主題音樂」；《正義女神》更由表現出色的佘詩曼及陳煒，分奪『最佳女主角』及『最佳女配角』兩大獎項，實在可喜可賀。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"012.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267w4F1oZf9P1790909677.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"012.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T03:19:20.477902+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":457,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}